WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.338
A ye min fɔ, a y'o kɛ. O ye Samow ni Musaw ka maana dɔ ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.320
Samoa jamana na, mɔgɔw tun be ɲɛnamaya kɛ cogo nɔgɔman na fɔɔ ka taga se o loon ma.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.312
Mɔgɔ minw tun bɛ yɛlɛn so kan, olugu nana ni buguri ye sankaba kɔnɔ.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.496
O dugukolo ye an ta ye sisan.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.762
Jamana kuntigi ma foyi fɔ. A y'a ka kalanbonbagaw wele.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.698
O kɔ, kɛlɛ daminɛna. Aw ye biɲɛw ta ka taga soow kama.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.616
An tora kɛrɛ ra lon bɛɛ, nka mɔgɔ si ma se sɔrɔ.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.064
Su donna kɛlɛkɛyɔrɔ la.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.952
Mɔgɔ minw tun tora, o tun ye mɔgɔ mandimininw dɔrɔn le ye.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.362
Kɛlɛden fila y'u ɲɛɛ sin ɲɔgɔn ma. O kɔ, u kelen kelen bɛɛ y'u ka dɔrɔ di ɲɔgɔn ma.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.808
Samusɔn muso dɔ nana, a lɔra sotigi dɔ ɲɛfɛ.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:36.034
A tun be sigasigara ani a y'a janto a la. Sotigi dɔ fana ye Samusɔn kɛlɛbaga dɔ faga.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:46.672
Mɔgɔ si tun tɛ se k'a hakili to a tɔɲɔgɔn ka yɔrɔ la tugun.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.052
Joli tun ka ca.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.644
An tɛ se ka joli bɔn tugun.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.040
O bɛɛ kelen kelen tun bɛ duvɛn min o kelen na.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.914
O kɔ, u ye ɲɔgɔn kunbɛn. Hɛɛrɛ tun be yen.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.848
Aw Musaw, aw be dumuni kɛ kojugu!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.896
Aw Samow kɔni, aw be kuma ka ca!

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:51.540
Kabini o wagati ra, o bɛ ɲɔgɔn lɔgɔbɔra; mɔgɔ si tɛ dimi tuun. O ye kuncɛbayakow lo ye.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:12.314
Hali bi, an be se k'a fɔ ko: "Kɛlɛ tɛna kɛ tugun".
